│  **7-Day Travel Itinerary for Madrid**                                                                        │
│                                                                                                               │
│  Madrid, the vibrant capital of Spain, is a treasure trove of art, history, food, and culture. Here's a       │
│  7-day travel itinerary that will help you make the most of your trip:                                        │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Day 1: Arrival and Exploration**                                                                           │
│                                                                                                               │
│  *   Arrive at Adolfo Suárez Madrid–Barajas Airport (MAD)                                                     │
│  *   Take the metro (line 8) to the city center                                                               │
│  *   Visit the Puerta del Sol, a famous square in the heart of Madrid                                         │
│  *   Explore the historic center, including Plaza Mayor and Calle Gran Vía                                    │
│  *   Check-in at Hotel NH Collection Madrid Palacio de Tepa (approximately €150 per night)                    │
│  *   Enjoy traditional Spanish cuisine for dinner at Botín                                                    │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Day 2: Art and Culture**                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                               │
│  *   Start the day with a visit to The Prado Museum, home to an extensive collection of European art          │
│  *   Explore the Reina Sofia Museum, which houses a vast collection of modern Spanish art                     │
│  *   Visit the Royal Palace of Madrid, a grand palace that serves as the official residence of the Spanish    │
│  royal family                                                                                                 │
│  *   Relax in Retiro Park, a beautiful urban park with gardens, sculptures, and plenty of walking paths       │
│  *   Enjoy dinner at El Qu Jetcho                                                                             │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Day 3: Food and Wine**                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                               │
│  *   Take a food tour to discover the best of Madrid's tapas scene                                            │
│  *   Visit the Mercado San Miguel, a beautiful marketplace with food stalls, bars, and shops selling local    │
│  products                                                                                                     │
│  *   Sample traditional Spanish cuisine for lunch at Casa Mono                                                │
│  *   Explore the historic center and visit the iconic Plaza Mayor                                             │
│  *   Enjoy dinner at La Tasquita de Enfrente                                                                  │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Day 4: History and Architecture**                                                                          │
│                                                                                                               │
│  *   Visit the Museo Sorolla, a museum showcasing the works of Spanish impressionist painter Joaquín Sorolla  │
│  *   Explore the Gothic Cathedral of San Isidro, a stunning example of medieval architecture                  │
│  *   Take a guided tour of the Sabatini Gardens, a beautiful park with gardens and sculptures                 │
│  *   Visit the nearby city of Toledo, a UNESCO World Heritage Site known for its rich history and stunning    │
│  architecture                                                                                                 │
│  *   Enjoy dinner at El Qu Jetcho                                                                             │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Day 5: Flamenco and Nightlife**                                                                            │
│                                                                                                               │
│  *   Experience live flamenco performances at tablao Corral de la Morería                                     │
│  *   Explore the historic center and visit the iconic Puerta del Sol                                          │
│  *   Visit the nearby Plaza Mayor, a famous square in the heart of Madrid                                     │
│  *   Enjoy dinner at Botín                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Day 6: Day Trip to Toledo**                                                                                │
│                                                                                                               │
│  *   Take a day trip to Toledo, a UNESCO World Heritage Site known for its rich history and stunning          │
│  architecture                                                                                                 │
│  *   Explore the Alcázar de Toledo, a medieval palace with stunning views of the city                         │
│  *   Visit the Cathedral of Toledo, a beautiful example of Gothic architecture                                │
│  *   Return to Madrid in the evening and enjoy dinner at El Qu Jetcho                                         │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Day 7: Departure**                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                               │
│  *   Spend the morning shopping for souvenirs or exploring the historic center                                │
│  *   Check-out of Hotel NH Collection Madrid Palacio de Tepa (approximately €150 per night)                   │
│  *   Take the metro (line 8) to Adolfo Suárez Madrid–Barajas Airport (MAD)                                    │
│  *   Depart from Madrid                                                                                       │
